{"title":"Juul Kit \u0026 Juul Pods Kenya","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNow We are Delivering Juul Device and Juul Pods in Kenya. Buy Juul Kenya now at your doorstep, The wait is over order your supplies until stock lasts. Limited quantities of Juul Starter Kit and Juul Pods, delivery only in Kenya.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"the-gem-portable-juul-powerbank","title":"The GEM Portable JUUL Powerbank Case","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe GEM Portable JUUL Powerbank is a petite and light portable battery charger for the JUUL vaporizer. The GEM Portable JUUL Powerbank holds a whopping 1000 mAh battery power and can charge the JUUL in 40 to 45 minutes whilst the Powerbank itself will take 2 to 2.5 hours to charge. The GEM Portable JUUL Powerbank utilizes a flip to open design allowing users to easily slide their JUUL device and JUUL pod in with no problem. The compact size, convenience, and the 1000 mAh battery capacity of the GEM Portable JUUL Powerbank makes it an amazing companion with your JUUL device!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJUUL Charging Case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eApproximate Charge Time to Charge JUUL: 40 to 45 Minutes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHolds One \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-basic-kit\" title=\"Buy Juul Device\"\u003eJUUL Device\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSold Separately\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHolds One \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/juul-kenya\" title=\"Juul Pods Kenya\"\u003eJUUL Pod\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSold Separately\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlip to Open Case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Sliding Drawer\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1000 mAh Battery Power\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB Charging Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life Indicator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eApproximate Charging Time: 2 to 2.5 Hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Includes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOne GEM Box Charging Case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOne Micro USB Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOne JUUL Skin (COMES IN RANDOM)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOne User Manual and Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"The GEM","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531771387959,"sku":"69d25d5001ebc","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/The-Gem-Portable-JUUL-Charger.jpg?v=1741710074"},{"product_id":"the-gem-juul-usb-charging-kit","title":"The GEM - JUUL USB Charging Kit","description":"\u003ch3\u003eAbout the GEM Magnetic USB JUUL Charger\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJUUL has really revolutionized the vaping industry. Their devices are the most advanced forms of temperature-regulated vapor technology on the market. They’re compact, sleek, stylish, and so easy to use. The fact that JUUL e-cigarettes are rechargeable is one of the most appealing features.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’ve misplaced or broken the USB charging cord that your JUUL device came with, or you just want to have an extra one available to keep in your office, car, home, or anywhere else, the GEM Magnetic USB JUUL Charger is a great choice. The cord is 2.6 feet long, which gives you plenty of flexibility. It works with JUUL devices that come with the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-starter-kit\" title=\"Juul Starter Kit\"\u003eJuul Starter Kit\u003c\/a\u003e, the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-basic-kit\" title=\"Juul basic kit\"\u003eJuul basic kit\u003c\/a\u003e, or the Silver Basic Limited Edition Kit. What’s more is that this magnetic USB charger works with any USB port.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GEM Magnetic USB JUUL Charger is a must-have accessory for any JUUL user.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003e2.6 Feet Long Cable Length\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eMagnetic USB charging cable for the JUUL Pods System.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eWall Adapter and Car adapter included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"The GEM","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531771420727,"sku":"69d25d5160c41","price":1250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/The_Gem_Juul_USB_Charger.jpg?v=1741710081"},{"product_id":"the-gem-juul-usb-charger","title":"The GEM - JUUL USB Charger","description":"\u003ch3\u003eAbout the GEM Magnetic USB JUUL Charger\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIrritated with Juul Charger? Now buy The Gem Juul charger with usb cable\/ wire. If you’ve misplaced or broken the USB charging cord that your JUUL device came with, or you just want to have an extra one available to keep in your office, car, home, or anywhere else, the GEM Magnetic USB JUUL Charger is a great choice. The cord is 2.6 feet long, which gives you plenty of flexibility. It works with JUUL devices that come with the \u003ca title=\"Juul Starter Kit\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-starter-kit\"\u003eJuul Starter Kit\u003c\/a\u003e, and the \u003ca title=\"Juul basic kit\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-basic-kit\"\u003eJuul Basic Kit\u003c\/a\u003e. What’s more is that this magnetic USB charger works with any USB port.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GEM Magnetic USB JUUL Charger is a must-have accessory for any JUUL user.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003e2.6 Feet Long Cable Length\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eMagnetic USB charging cable for the JUUL Pods System.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"The GEM","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531771486263,"sku":"69d25d51ae67a","price":960.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/the-gem-magnetic-juul-usb-charger-1pc.jpg?v=1741710088"},{"product_id":"the-gem-slim-portable-juul-powerbank","title":"The GEM SLIM Portable JUUL Powerbank","description":"\u003cp\u003eNever worry about your JUUL running out of power again at the wrong time with the Juul GEM Slim Single Power Bank charger. This compact charger allows you to charge your JUUL up to three times when fully charged.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GEM Slim is charged via a micro USB cable with LED indicator, letting you know when it is fully charged and ready to go. Whether you work outside all day or at a music festival, this is a must have for your JUUL. (JUUL sold separately)\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSet complete set:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInternal battery 1000 mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicro USB cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"The GEM","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531771748407,"sku":"69d25d51c23e6","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/gem-slim-single-power-bank-juul-charger.jpg?v=1741710095"},{"product_id":"juul2-autumn-tobacco-pods","title":"JUUL2 Autumn Tobacco Pods (2 Pods)","description":"\u003cp\u003eAutumn tobacco JUUL2 pods feature mellow tobacco flavour with tangy orchard harvest notes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJUUL2 pods are only to be used with a JUUL2 Device. The JUUL2 Device is designed to only function with authentic JUUL2 pods manufactured by Juul Labs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's In The Box?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x JUUL2 pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAutumn tobacco flavour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 JUUL2 pod contains: ~1.2 mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine concentration: ~18 mg\/mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal nicotine content: ~21.6 mg\/JUUL2 pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eJUUL2 pods contain their uniquely satisfying e-liquid.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e18 mg\/ml nicotine strength. Each pack contains 2 pods. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur e-liquid contains a proprietary formulation which includes Vegetable glycerin, Propylene glycol, Water, Nicotine, Benzoic acid, flavourings. You should not use this product if you are allergic to nicotine or to any other ingredient that it contains. See JUUL2 pods packaging for additional ingredient and safety information. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652480344119,"sku":"JL2 Autumn Tobacco Pods","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juulpods-2-autumn-tobacco-pod-2-pack.jpg?v=1746632001"},{"product_id":"juul2-usb-charging-dock","title":"JUUL2 USB Charging Dock","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003ePlug JUUL2 Charging Dock into a USB port. Lay JUUL2 Device sideways on magnetic dock. Charge as needed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUse only with a JUUL2 Device. \u003cstrong\u003eJUUL2 Device sold separately.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eInside The Box\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x JUUL2 charging dock\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652480376887,"sku":"JL2 USB Charger","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juul2-charging-dock.jpg?v=1746632005"},{"product_id":"juul2-basic-kit","title":"JUUL2 Basic Kit","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNow with more cigarette-like satisfaction, JUUL2 is an easy-to-use, next generation JUUL device designed for adult smokers looking for an alternative to cigarettes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe all-day battery has up to 20% more capacity. The JUUL2 device kit comes with a device and charging dock.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe JUUL2 device is designed to only function with authentic JUUL2 pods\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003emanufactured by Juul Labs. JUUL2 pods contain nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eJUUL2pods not included and sold separately. \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFeatures\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIntegrated Battery: 250mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eLight indicator for charge status, battery level, e-liquid level and pod authenticity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCompatible with the JUUL APP only available for Android™ platform\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eKit includes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eRechargeable JUUL2 device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eUSB charging dock\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652480442423,"sku":"JL2 Basic Kit","price":4600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juul2-device-kit-new.jpg?v=1746632017"},{"product_id":"juul2-starter-kit-with-2-pods","title":"JUUL2 Starter Kit with 2 Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eNow with more cigarette-like satisfaction, JUUL2 is an easy-to-use, next generation JUUL Device designed for adult smokers looking for an alternative to cigarettes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe JUUL2 starter kit comes with a device, charging dock and 2 pods: Virginia tobacco and crisp menthol. Each pack contains 2 x 18 mg \/ ml nicotine strength pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe JUUL2 device is designed to only function with authentic JUUL2 pods manufactured by Juul Labs. JUUL2 pods contain nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnly compatible with JUUL2pods.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKit includes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x JUUL2 device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x USB Charging Dock\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x JUUL2 pods (1 x Virginia Tobacco and 1 x Crisp Menthol) 18 mg \/ ml nicotine strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Battery: 250mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndicator lights for charge status, battery level, e-liquid level and pod authenticity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePods Nicotine Level: 18mg\/ml nicotine salts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with the JUUL APP only available for Android™ platform\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe also have \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-starter-kit\" title=\"Juul starter kit with pods\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eJuul Starter Kit with 4 Pods\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-basic-kit\" title=\"Juul basic kit\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eJuul Basic Kit\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652480606263,"sku":"JL2 Starter Kit","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juul2-starter-kit-new.jpg?v=1746632031"},{"product_id":"juul-starter-kit","title":"JUUL Starter Kit - Juul 4 Pods Kit","description":"\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAbout JUUL Pod Mod Starter Kit –\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eJuul is designed and developed keeping smokers habits and health activities in mind, which makes JUUL the finest brand in technical terms of Vaping Kenya. The Main function JUUL did to its vaping pods is “Removed all complicated operations from JUUL Pod Mod Starter Kits”. Above \u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Vaporizer Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\"\u003eVaporizer \u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003eis just operated with no buttons but the mouth of the vape users.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eJUUL device is very simple to use as compare to Vaporizers available in market. No heavy weights and bulky devices anymore with \u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/juul-kenya\" title=\"Juul pods Kenya\"\u003eJUUL pods online\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e by \u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/\" title=\"Vape Kenya\"\u003e[YOUR BRAND]\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e. The Pod devices are clean and easy to operate with “Plug and Play” Function.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFunctions and Impressions of JUUL Kenya –\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe JUUL has user friendly design which results only pros and not a single\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ILfuVd NA6bn\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003econtra. JUUL broker Vape market due to its tiny size and weight less than a Pen Drive.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eMain Technical Features-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAutomatic Temperature Control and Longs lasting battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDouble Tap battery life check indicator (Green Light – Full Charge | Yellow Light – Low Battery)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDefault Fast charging  (One hour charging time for a day uses)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNo nearby competitors with JUUL technology.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eJUUL Pre-filled Cartridges Details-\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSwitching E liquid flavor in Other Vaporizers and E cigarettes is messy and time consuming or sometimes changing e liquid many cause spending of extra bucks on Flavors. JUUL Device comes with 4 Pre-filled cartridges with Nicotine strength of 5% or 1.7% by weight.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003ePre-Filled Cartridges in 5% Multi Pack-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-pods-virginia-tobacco\" title=\"Juul virginia tobacco pod\"\u003eVirginia Tobacco\u003c\/a\u003e (5%)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eMint (5%)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCreme (5%)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eMango (5%), or\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePre- Filled Cartridges in 18mg Multi Pack-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGolden Tobacco (18mg)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMint (18mg)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenthol (18mg)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMango (18mg)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePre- Filled Cartridges in 1.7% Multi Pack-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGlacier Mint (1.7%)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGolden Tobacco \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e(1.7%)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRoyal Creme \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e(1.7%)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMango Nectar \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e(1.7%)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eALso you can buy, \u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-basic-kit\" title=\"Juul kit Kenya\"\u003eJUUL basic kit\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e comes with a JUUL device and USB charging dock, pods not included. For smokers seeking a genuine alternative to cigarettes.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"5% MULTI PACK","offer_id":41652480639031,"sku":"JL Starter Kit - 4 Pods","price":5599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"1.7% MULTI PACK","offer_id":41652480671799,"sku":"JL Starter Kit - 4 Pods","price":5559.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juul-starter-kit.jpg?v=1746632038"},{"product_id":"juul-starter-kit-juul-2-pods-kit","title":"JUUL Starter Kit - Juul 2 Pods Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe JUUL Starter Kit includes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRechargeable JUUL Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB Charging Dock\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo JUUL pods (Menthol Pods)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe also have \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-starter-kit\" title=\"juul starter kit Kenya\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eJuul Starter Kit with 4 Pods\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-basic-kit\" title=\"juul basic kit\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eJuul Basic Kit\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652480737335,"sku":"JL Starter Kit","price":5300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Juul-2-POD-Starter-Kit-2.jpg?v=1746632042"},{"product_id":"juul-basic-kit","title":"JUUL Basic Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eThe Juul device is a sleek and compact vaporizer that is designed to be easy to use and comfortable to hold. It features a simple one-button design that activates the device and delivers a smooth vaping experience. The device is also equipped with a battery indicator light that lets users know when it needs to be recharged.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe JUUL Basic Kit includes:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRechargeable JUUL Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB Charging Dock\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNote: Juul Basic Kit doesn't includes pods and is only compatible with Juul pods only.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652480770103,"sku":"JL Basic Kit","price":3500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juul-basic-kit.jpg?v=1746632045"},{"product_id":"juul-pods-classic-tobacco","title":"Juul Pods Classic Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003eJuul Classic Tobacco Pod with an unique classic taste as of cigarette. Juul Pods have different strength according to one's consumption. You can choose nicotine strength above according to your body need.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"5%","offer_id":41652480802871,"sku":"69d25d58570d2","price":3200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3%","offer_id":41652480835639,"sku":"69d25d57b9ba9","price":2299.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Juul-Pods-Classic-Tobacco-Kenya.jpg?v=1746632048"},{"product_id":"juul-pods-virginia-tobacco","title":"Juul Pods Virginia Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eJuul Virginia Tobacco Pod with an unique Virginia taste as of cigarette tobacco. Juul Pods have different strength according to one's consumption. You can choose nicotine strength above according to your body need.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"5%","offer_id":41652480868407,"sku":"JL Pods VT 5%","price":2850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3%","offer_id":41652480901175,"sku":"JL Pods VT 3%","price":2850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/virginia_tobacco_juul.jpg?v=1746632050"},{"product_id":"juul-pods-cucumber","title":"Juul Pods Cucumber","description":"\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCucumber pods are a true testament to the one-of-a-kind experience that they provide. Their Cucumber pods offer a truly unique flavor. It’s the perfect blend of refreshing taste combined with the exhilarating rush of nicotine. \u003c\/span\u003e Juul Pods have different strength according to one's consumption. You can choose nicotine strength above according to your body need.","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"5%","offer_id":41652480966711,"sku":"JL Pods Cucumber 5%","price":3000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/JUUL-Pods-Cucumber.png?v=1746632056"},{"product_id":"juul-usb-charger","title":"Juul Device USB Charger","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eAbout the JUUL USB Charger\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHave you misplaced or damaged the USB charger that your \u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/juul-kenya\" title=\"juul\"\u003eJUUL device \u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003ecame with? Do you just want to have another USB charger to keep in your car, office, or anywhere else that you frequent? If so, then the JUUL USB replacement charger is exactly what you need.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eKey Details of the JUUL USB Charger\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e Magnetic USB charger that’s compatible with JUUL devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e Magnetic charging device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e Fully charges JUUL devices in about an hour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e No messy cables\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e Charge from your Mac, PC, or any USB port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652480999479,"sku":"JL Device USB Charger","price":999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juul-usb-charger_1.jpg?v=1746632060"},{"product_id":"juul-pods-multipack","title":"Juul Pods Multipack","description":"\u003cp\u003eIf you enjoy switching up your vaping flavors on a regular basis or you aren’t sure which flavor you really like and want to explore some options before committing to a pack of \u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Juul pods Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/juul-kenya\"\u003eJUUL pods in Kenya\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e that features just one flavor, then JUUL Pod Multipack is a great choice for you. This package of JUUL pods features four of the most popular JUUL flavors, including classic Virginia Tobacco and refreshing Cool Mint. All pods are compatible with the JUUL device that comes with the Starter Kit, the Basic Kit, or the Silver Basic Kit Limited Edition. Just connect the pod flavor of your choice to your device and you’re ready to start enjoying truly remarkable flavor and the stratifying rush of nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso, buy \u003ca title=\"Juul basic kit\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-basic-kit\"\u003ejuul basic kit\u003c\/a\u003e and make a complete set of your juul.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Details of the JUUL Pod Multipack\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA package of four premium-quality JUUL salt e-liquid pods in four unique flavors, including Virginia Tobacco and Cool Mint.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEach pod is pre-filled with 0.7ml of JUULs e-liquid nicotine salt, which contains 5%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEach pod offers approximately 200 puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 Pack Includes Crème Brulee and Mango Flavors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePre-Filled Cartridges in 5% Multi Pack-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-pods-virginia-tobacco\" title=\"Juul virginia tobacco pod\"\u003eVirginia Tobacco\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e(5%)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMint(5%)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePre- Filled Cartridges in 18mg Multi Pack-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGolden Tobacco (18mg)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMint (18mg)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenthol (18mg)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMango (18mg)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Juul Pods Multipack 5%","offer_id":41652481065015,"sku":"JL Pods Multipack 5%","price":2750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Juul Pods Multipack 18mg","offer_id":41652481097783,"sku":"JL Pods Multipack 1.8%","price":2750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Multi-Pack.png?v=1746632065"},{"product_id":"juul-pods-menthol-18","title":"Juul Pods Menthol","description":"\u003cp\u003eBold menthol flavour with an icy finish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e18mg, 30mg and 50mg nicotine strength. Each pack contains 4 pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJUUL e-liquid contains a proprietary formulation that combines glycerol, propylene glycol, natural oils, extracts and flavour, nicotine and benzoic acid. Together with temperature-regulated vapour technology, this proprietary chemistry enables JUUL to deliver a vapour experience like no other.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContents:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 x JUUL Menthol e-liquid pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenthol flavour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"5%","offer_id":41652481130551,"sku":"JL Pods Menthol - 5%","price":2750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3%","offer_id":41652481163319,"sku":"JL Pods Menthol - 3%","price":2750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"1.8%","offer_id":41652481196087,"sku":"JL Pods Menthol - 1.8%","price":2750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Juul-Menthol-5mg-min.jpg?v=1746632071"},{"product_id":"juul-pods-mint-18","title":"Juul Pods Mint 1.8%","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eMint is a bold and crisp mint flavour with an icy finish.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eJUULpods are designed to fit the JUUL Vapouriser. Only use JUULpods in your JUUL Vapouriser.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eOur JUULsalts e-liquid contain nicotine salts found in the tobacco leaf, rather than free-base nicotine used in most e-cigarettes and vapourizers. Together with temperature-regulated vapour technology, this proprietary chemistry enables JUUL to deliver a vapour experience like no other.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThese pods have 18mg nicotine strength and deliver approximately 300 puffs per pod.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652481228855,"sku":"JL Pods Mint 1.8%","price":2490.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juul-mint-18mg.jpg?v=1746632073"},{"product_id":"juul2-blackcurrant-tobacco-pods","title":"JUUL2 Blackcurrant Tobacco Pods (2 Pods)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlackcurrant Tobacco JUUL2 pods feature mellow tobacco flavour with a twist of fresh blackcurrant to provide a smoky, yet fruity vape.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJUUL2 pods are only to be used with a JUUL2 Device. The JUUL2 Device is designed to only function with authentic JUUL2 pods manufactured by Juul Labs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's In The Box?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x JUUL2 pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVirginia Tobacco flavour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 JUUL2 pod contains: ~1.2 mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine concentration: ~18 mg\/mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal nicotine content: ~21.6 mg\/JUUL2 pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/juul-kenya\"\u003eJUUL2 pods\u003c\/a\u003e contain their uniquely satisfying e-liquid.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e18 mg\/ml nicotine strength. Each pack contains 2 pods. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur e-liquid contains a proprietary formulation which includes Vegetable glycerin, Propylene glycol, Water, Nicotine, Benzoic acid, flavourings. You should not use this product if you are allergic to nicotine or to any other ingredient that it contains. See JUUL2 pods packaging for additional ingredient and safety information. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652483129399,"sku":"JL2 Blackcurrant Tobacco Pods","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juul2-blackcurrant-tobacco.jpg?v=1746632348"},{"product_id":"juul2-virginia-tobacco-pods","title":"JUUL2 Virginia Tobacco Pods (2 Pods)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eVirginia tobacco JUUL2 pods feature a fresh green menthol flavour with a brisk, cooling finish. Each pack contains 2 18mg\/mL nicotine strength pods.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJUUL2 pods are only to be used with a JUUL2 Device. The JUUL2 Device is designed to only function with authentic JUUL2 pods manufactured by Juul Labs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's In The Box?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x JUUL2 pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVirginia Tobacco flavour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 JUUL2 pod contains: ~1.2 mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine concentration: ~18 mg\/mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal nicotine content: ~21.6 mg\/JUUL2 pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eJUUL2 pods contain their uniquely satisfying e-liquid.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e18 mg\/ml nicotine strength. Each pack contains 2 pods. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur e-liquid contains a proprietary formulation which includes Vegetable glycerin, Propylene glycol, Water, Nicotine, Benzoic acid, flavourings. You should not use this product if you are allergic to nicotine or to any other ingredient that it contains. See JUUL2 pods packaging for additional ingredient and safety information. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652483227703,"sku":"JL2 VT Pods","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/juulpods-2-virginia-tobacco-pod-2-pack.jpg?v=1746632356"},{"product_id":"juul2-summer-menthol-pods-2-pods","title":"JUUL2 Summer Menthol Pods (2 Pods)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSummer Menthol JUUL2 pods feature a lush, tropical flavour with a breezy cooling exhale.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJUUL2 pods are only to be used with a JUUL2 Device. The JUUL2 Device is designed to only function with authentic JUUL2 pods manufactured by Juul Labs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's In The Box?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x JUUL2 pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSummer Menthol flavour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 JUUL2 pod contains: ~1.2 mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine concentration: ~18 mg\/mL \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal nicotine content: ~21.6 mg\/JUUL2 pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eJUUL2 pods contain their uniquely satisfying e-liquid.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e18 mg\/ml nicotine strength. Each pack contains 2 pods. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur e-liquid contains a proprietary formulation which includes Vegetable glycerin, Propylene glycol, Water, Nicotine, Benzoic acid, flavourings. You should not use this product if you are allergic to nicotine or to any other ingredient that it contains. See JUUL2 pods packaging for additional ingredient and safety information. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Juul","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652483293239,"sku":"JL2 S